{"id":"int-c193acbb","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-05-15T19:52:44.218111161Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-tan","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Completed remaining parent scope: schema drifts now have an alert scope flag, live delivery/replay candidates, template variables drift_field/drift_type/sample_value/drift_line, UI rule toggle, migration, and tests."}}
{"id":"int-f99b6c79","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-05-16T09:47:52.516746549Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-u7q","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Added _pick_sample_value helper that threads CardinalityResult.sample_values into _diff_event_type_schema for new_field/type_changed drift (missing_field stays null — no observed data). _upsert_schema_drifts persists sample_value and refreshes it on conflict. Both call sites in metrics.py pass cardinality results defensively via getattr to keep mock-based unit tests working. New tripl.worker.tasks.maintenance.cleanup_schema_drifts task + daily Celery beat schedule prunes SchemaDrift rows past DRIFT_RETENTION_DAYS. UI: EventDriftBadge popover renders 'e.g. <sample>' under each drift entry. Tests: 172 backend (+2), ruff+mypy clean."}}
{"id":"int-9db98fb3","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-05-16T14:32:43.720659225Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-v27","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"simulate_rule_firings accepts cooldown_minutes_override (keyword-only). simulate_rule service: _render_firing_item + _render_firings_message build a sync preview reusing alert_templates (no DB-bound sparkline/top_movers — those are session-rich and out of scope for replay). New response fields: rendered_message (overall message text), per-firing rendered_item, cooldown_minutes_used, cooldown_minutes_saved. API endpoint exposes cooldown_minutes_override query param (0..10080). Frontend: RuleReplayDialog gets cooldown override Input; on Replay issues Promise.all(saved, override) when override differs, shows side-by-side FiringsCountBadge with both counts and Noisy flag, plus a Preview <pre> block of rendered_message. Tests: 173 backend (+1 — endpoint asserts override path + preview text), 33 frontend, ruff+mypy+tsc+eslint clean."}}
{"id":"int-cf9cc4b4","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-05-16T20:24:31.636994935Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-zl0","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Phase A: useEventsQuery hook owns URL filter state (search/implemented/tag/silent_days/reviewed + f./m. prefixed) + deferred+debounced values + isFilterPending + filterEtId/Reviewed/Archived derivation + useInfiniteQuery + flattened rawEvents+total. Phase B: EventsTable presentational component owns the DndContext+SortableContext+TooltipProvider tree, header with FilterableHead+ColumnFilter, virtualized TableBody+EventRow mapping, EmptyState. EventsPage.tsx 1412 -> 1147 (-265 lines, -19%). Mutations and layout glue still live in EventsPage. Tests: 33 frontend (unchanged), tsc+lint clean."}}
{"id":"int-01e4368b","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-05-16T20:27:29.44882236Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-b7e","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Already shipped (commits 933c45e / 4131e5f / 062b0aa, well before this session). frontend/src/components/command-palette.tsx implements: global Cmd+K / Ctrl+K binding via CommandPaletteProvider wired into Layout; cmdk-react Dialog with Navigate / Current project / Settings & event-type sections; TanStack-cached projectsApi.list, eventTypesApi.list, eventsApi.list(search) with staleTime=30-60s; project-scoped entries when on a /p/:slug route, global entries otherwise; debounced fuzzy event search; Esc closes. 3 passing tests at command-palette.test.tsx."}}
{"id":"int-957b734c","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-05-17T08:39:20.625824402Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-8c0","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"New plan_revisions table (Alembic 9e0f1a2b3c4d). build_plan_snapshot constructs deterministic JSON over event types + field definitions + events + variables + meta fields + relations (sorted by natural key, UUIDs / order / timestamps excluded from comparison fields). compute_plan_diff_entries does natural-key set difference per entity type, surfaces field-level changes for the fields that matter (field_type, is_required, enum_options, implemented/reviewed/archived, etc.). API: POST/GET /projects/{slug}/revisions, GET /revisions/{id}, GET /revisions/{id}/diff?compare_to={other}. Frontend: HistoryTab in ProjectSettingsPage with revision list + 'Snapshot now' button + side-by-side diff against previous revision. Tests: 176 backend (+3 — snapshot composition, diff classification, full POST→GET→diff round-trip), 33 frontend. ruff+mypy+tsc+eslint clean."}}
{"id":"int-21d4115f","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-05-17T09:00:10.862423068Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-iky","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Postgres warehouse adapter shipped: new PostgresAdapter (full BaseAdapter contract using psycopg, date_bin bucketing, GROUPING SETS, ROW_NUMBER top-N), registry-based build_adapter factory replacing 4 duplicate _build_adapter functions, DBType enum + db_type selector in DataSourcesPage with port auto-default. Backend 179/179 pytest, ruff/mypy clean. Frontend 33/33 vitest, lint/typecheck clean."}}
{"id":"int-59c26a0f","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-05-17T09:10:04.552353202Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-3m1","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"BigQuery warehouse adapter shipped: BigQueryAdapter via google-cloud-bigquery SDK, TIMESTAMP_BIN bucketing (week normalized to 7 day, month routed to TIMESTAMP_TRUNC), JSON_KEYS for path discovery, GROUPING SETS + ROW_NUMBER for top-N. Service-account JSON stored in password_encrypted, project_id in host, default dataset in database_name, optional location in extra_params. Frontend DataSourcesPage switches form to project_id + default-dataset + textarea credentials when bigquery is selected. Backend 179/179 pytest, ruff+mypy clean. Frontend 33/33 vitest, lint+typecheck clean."}}
