{"id":"int-90127dcc","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-06-28T11:42:45.489635014Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-qqi7","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Security/Storage/Observability overrides are now applied onto settings at process startup (apply_startup_service_overrides) in both the API and worker entrypoints, before middleware/rate-limiters/logging/metrics are wired — so they take effect on restart (the 'next deploy' UI contract). Docs updated."}}
{"id":"int-0bb8d5db","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-06-28T12:01:36.524056174Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-x4tw","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Built the Anomalies page (Observe, /p/:slug/anomalies — cross-event open-signal list, badge = open-signal count) and the Coverage page (Govern, /p/:slug/coverage — canonical plan-coverage rollup + instrumentation-gaps from dead-events). Added routes, nav items (Observe›Anomalies, Govern›Coverage), updated navigation + app-sidebar tests, and documented both surfaces in feature-reference.md. tsc/eslint/355 vitest/vite build/docs build all green."}}
{"id":"int-c8383778","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-06-28T13:04:18.125408205Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-u4x","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Closed as won't-do (2026-06-28). Codebase audit: zero BI-integration infrastructure exists (no BI client, table, Celery task, or endpoint). The existing warehouse-adapter pattern (SQL) is architecturally orthogonal to BI tool REST/GraphQL APIs. The epic cannot be scoped or estimated until a specific target BI tool is chosen. Re-file with a concrete tool target when downstream-usage impact analysis is prioritized."}}
{"id":"int-bcd61c4b","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-06-28T13:43:07.556034654Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-g9bh","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Implemented + tested (2026-06-28). transition_branch('submit') now calls assign_owner_reviewers_for_branch (plan_branch_merge_service): resolves touched event types' owners (load_owner_user_ids on main rows), upserts them into plan_branch_reviewers, skips the branch author (no self-review), idempotent via (branch_id,user_id) unique key. No migration. +2 tests in test_plan_branches.py (auto-assign + skip-author); 32 tests pass, ruff+mypy clean."}}
{"id":"int-185274c5","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-06-28T13:43:11.048640173Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-wi69","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Implemented + tested (2026-06-28). Added ScanConfig.platform_column (migration b3c4d5e6f7a9, chained after f1a2b3c4d5e7; reserved like app_version_column). Worker (metric_rows.py) collects it as a deduped scan-level breakdown -> EventMetricBreakdown. GET /projects/{slug}/scans/{id}/platform-presence (metrics_service.get_platform_presence) derives the per-event presence matrix from those rows (no new table). Frontend: form field + presence grid in ScanDetail (10 files). Backend 56 tests + alembic-graph green; FE tsc/eslint/vitest 20/build green."}}
{"id":"int-57d9a3ec","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-06-29T05:41:24.918762931Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-wyed","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Implemented + tested (2026-06-29). Added DataSource.json_path_discovery ('all'|'dynamic'|null; migration c4d5e6f7a8b1). ClickHouseAdapter takes the mode (default 'dynamic') and the JSON path *discovery* query (get_json_path_samples) now uses JSONDynamicPaths (only important typed subcolumn paths, faster) vs JSONAllPaths; resolved via _JSON_PATH_DISCOVERY_FUNCS, wired through registry._build_clickhouse. Scan-time JSONAllPaths extraction unchanged. Frontend: CH-gated 'JSON path discovery' select with help text on the data source form. Backend 585 pytest + ruff + mypy + alembic-graph + OpenAPI snapshot green; FE tsc/eslint/vitest 12/build green; api.gen.ts regenerated."}}
{"id":"int-456c605d","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-06-29T10:25:27.870594862Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-gnrf","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Fixed (2026-06-29). reserved_catalog_columns(config) in worker/tasks/metrics/tasks.py now includes app_version_column and platform_column alongside event_type_column/time_column, so these reserved metric-dimension columns are no longer materialized as FieldDefinitions (they were leaking onto the events table as a useless 'version'/'platform' column with non-deterministic per-event sample values). +2 unit tests (reserved_catalog_columns set; _ensure_event_type_with_fields skip). Backend 70 metrics/generator tests green, ruff+mypy clean. NOTE: pre-existing stale fields are not auto-removed — delete once via UI (won't recur)."}}
{"id":"int-24aa741a","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-06-29T13:37:30.209662342Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-dxhp.1","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Closed"}}
{"id":"int-88cf5ecb","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-06-29T14:52:21.513974529Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-dxhp.2","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Landed: MetricValue + MetricValueBreakdown models (metric-scoped, Float value, optional scan_config_id grid alignment), dialect-aware UPSERT/window-delete helpers in metric_rows.py, migration e9f0a1b2c3d4 (single head). Tests green. Note: NULL scan_config_id rows are not de-duped by the unique constraint — .5 collectors must supply a config id or use window-delete-then-insert."}}
{"id":"int-7f6add04","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-06-29T14:52:25.457567037Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-dxhp.3","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Landed: get_time_bucketed_aggregate + breakdown variant across CH/PG/BQ (count/sum/avg/min/max/count_distinct); measure_validator.py with validate_identifier/validate_sql_fragment/validate_select_sql(_safety)/coerce_aggregation/build_aggregate_sql; identifier-allowlist + literal-escaping, NO bound params. UNION banned, paren-depth FROM detection, ClickHouse _validate_interval added to new AND pre-existing count methods. Existing count path SQL unchanged. Security re-verify: injection surface closed."}}
{"id":"int-01ce0baf","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-06-29T14:52:28.317675405Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-dxhp.4","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Landed: schemas/metric_definition.py (kind-discriminated union; every identifier/SQL field gated via measure_validator at the schema boundary), metric_definition_service.py (CRUD/list/bulk/reorder/move, slug->project, 409 uniqueness, ref-existence checks), api/v1/metrics_catalog.py under /projects/{slug}/metrics (EditorUserDep + audit). openapi.json regenerated. Tests green."}}
{"id":"int-27c48eb5","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-06-29T15:57:28.209163266Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-dxhp.5","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Landed: collect_metric_definitions worker task (fact/sql via M3 adapters + interval-chunked window-delete-then-upsert into metric_values; event_composition via pure worker/analyzers/metric_composition evaluator on the shared scan grid; per_distinct_user denominator via warehouse count_distinct). Beat check_metric_definitions_due with separate advisory lock + stale-running reap. Inline last_collected/status/error. Fixed in-workflow: union-derived delete window for ratio, UTC bucket coercion on fact path. 15 collection tests + 47 metrics_tasks regression green. CARRY TO .6: value NOT NULL means divide-by-zero buckets are skipped (absent), not stored NULL — resolve with the value-kind work (nullable value + null-aware zero-fill)."}}
{"id":"int-940afe73","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-06-29T15:57:31.844400596Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-dxhp.7","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Landed: metric_series_service (densify + anomaly join + 1-step forecast, reusing metrics_service helpers read-only) with GET series/breakdowns/versions under /projects/{slug}/metrics; catalog list enriched with latest_value/latest_bucket/latest_signal/spark via 2 batched window-function queries. Float-shaped response models (not EventMetricsResponse) to preserve <1 ratios. Fixed in-workflow: deterministic scan_config selection (ORDER BY bucket), window-function-bounded spark query. 17 series + 28 catalog regression green. SEAMS for .6: anomaly reads match on scope_ref=metric_definition_id (no scope_type yet); .6 must keep writing that scope_ref, add MetricScopeType.metric, add a (scope_ref,bucket) index on metric_anomalies, and decide scan_config stamping for sql/fact metrics. Densify gap-fills 0.0 — .6 value-kind flag must make ratio/avg gaps null, not 0."}}
{"id":"int-979df847","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-06-29T17:15:47.282667185Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-dxhp.6","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Landed: MetricScopeType += metric (ALTER TYPE in autocommit block, migration a1b2c3d4e5f6 incl. partial unique index WHERE scan_config_id IS NULL, nullable MetricAnomaly.scan_config_id, (scope_ref,bucket) index, detect_metrics, include_metrics). detect.py recomputes metric-scope anomalies (NULL scan_config_id, idempotent via partial index); value-kind helper is_count_shaped gates zero-fill/min_expected_count so ratio/avg don't false-fire, and metric_series densify renders fractional gaps as null. Threaded scope through signals/dispatch/alert_payload/alerting_matching/get_active_signals; include_metrics gates delivery (SAFE OFF); per-project canonical AlertRuleState avoids multi-config dupes. Full backend suite 801 passed."}}
{"id":"int-c6dd050f","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-06-29T17:15:50.823082217Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-dxhp.8","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Landed: metricsCatalogApi + types (regenerated api.gen.ts), MetricsPage (MiniStat + table, latest value/signal + sparkline, filters), MetricForm with kind-specific config sections + per-kind validation mirroring the backend discriminated union (config immutable on edit), metric drilldown via new 'metric' MonitoringScope reusing MonitoringDetailPage (Volume/Versions/Breakdowns), nav + lazy routes. Anomaly visuals gated on signal.state. Checkpoint fixes: MetricScopeType union +metric, getMonitoringPath metric case, nullable scan_config_id. tsc + eslint clean, 53 vitest pass."}}
